WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.820
All fright! All fright!

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:03.930
It sure feels like Halloween!

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:05.850
We've got special coords again-pri!

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.010
Hey, look at Jululu!

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.810
Trick or treat!

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:14.860
Twee! Twee!

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:21.770
It's a pumpkin castle!

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:24.500
Looks like they changed all the buildings-pri!

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:27.130
A spectacular vision! They've really put thought into this.

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:28.660
It's kind of scary, though...

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:30.250
It looks tasty.

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:34.880
Happy Halloween!

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:36.300
Meganii?

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:39.020
He looks wonderful in this year's costume too!

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:41.260
Ladies and girls!

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:44.720
We have a happy world of horror in store for you today!

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:46.720
Its name...

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:50.110
The PriPara Halloween Stamp Rally!

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:52.220
That looks pretty fun!

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:55.880
If there's a stamp rally, does that maybe mean a pri-ze?

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:57.530
It most certainly does.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:01.610
Within the pumpkin castle lies a great maze,

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:06.090
and the first team to reach the exit will perform at today's main event!

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:08.160
All right – first place, here we come!

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:09.870
However...

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:13.630
The prettiest flower has thorns. Delicious food has needles.

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:17.700
Within the maze lie <i>frightening</i> traps.

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:21.130
You must win points by clearing them.

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:25.690
Lala's totally freaked out – what a chicken!

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:26.810
Dorothy.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.600
You're in a cold sweat-pri.

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:29.930
Ulp.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:32.080
As–As if I am!

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:35.850
I didn't even cry when I was 12 years old and saw the namahage festival masks, you know.

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:37.970
It's fine, it's fine-pri.

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:42.280
Unscientific things like ghosts don't exist; you've got nothing to be afraid of.

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:45.250
Even if something <i>does</i> happen, I'll protect you.

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:46.660
There's nothing to fear.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:51.280
Like I said, I ain't scared of any of that! Hmph max!

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:53.700
Dorothy, relax!

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:57.610
That's right-usa! You three'll come in first and seize the main performance!

00:03:57.610 --> 00:04:01.030
Just a moment-kuma! The winners are gonna be SoLaMi SMILE, you hear?

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:06.470
<i>Your</i> SoLaMi SMILE has the total scaredy-rabbit Lala...
That Dorothy of yours talks big, but she's a wimp!

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:11.110
Such lunacy they speak. <i>I</i> will be the one performing today.

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.780
I have high hopes, Chiri.

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:15.260
I wonder about that.

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:15.650
Hm?

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.640
The winner's gonna be yours truly.

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:20.140
My Non isn't scared of ghosts at all.

00:04:20.140 --> 00:04:21.860
We'll be stealing the spotlight-ucha.

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:23.030
Ucha!

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.230
Pepper, stop right there!

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:27.620
Our promise is for <i>after</i> you form a team-ucha!

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:30.040
O-<i>kay</i>...

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:33.260
Now, let the Halloween Stamp Rally...

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:34.660
be opened!

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:43.310
As you clear each trap in each chamber,

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:47.470
scan your Rosette Pact at the exit's checkpoint.

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.760
Let's get going – onward and upward-pri!

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:53.080
We'll get to the goal first and claim that Halloween performance-kuma!

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:58.440
Jululu, we can't use a stroller in here, so just stay inside.

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:03.860
Here we are – let's go-pri!

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.250
Scrape...

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:10.870
Scrape...

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:13.580
Wh–What's that...

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.660
Chop-chop-chop-chop...

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:31.350
Boil-boil-boil-boil...

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:33.860
Um...

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:36.240
Are we... allowed to eat it?

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:43.620
It's delicious!

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:46.050
Mama!

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:47.570
Do you want some too, Jululu?

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.040
Okay, say "ah"!

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:58.250
Thanks for the meal-pri!
Thanks for the meal!

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:07.850
Uh, so... we cleared it-pri?

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:10.450
I'm so glad it wasn't too scary.

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:13.780
I hope it's pumpkin pie next time.

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:19.330
Now, shall a demon emerge? A serpent?

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:24.140
I–I–If you're scared, Reona, y–you can hide behind me...

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:25.940
If you say so, Dorothy!

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:27.930
Good day to you!

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:29.610
Hello...

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:34.120
Well hey, treasure boxes!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.580
"Choose whichever you like"...

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.040
Well, it's gotta be the bigger one!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.000
Wait, that's not how this sort of thing goes–

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.620
M–My apologies. I attacked you out of reflex.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:55.710
Dorothy, are you okay?

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:59.170
Of... of course I am... This isn't anything to be afraid of...

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:00.850
Dorothy...

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:03.810
But, they're kind of...

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:06.030
This isn't the least bit scary!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:10.570
Your mask is ill-fitting, and your round saucer-eyes aren't intimidating at all!

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:15.990
How do you imagine that squat, sluggish form would inspire fear in anyone?

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:18.620
Fanged apostle, dole out divine retribution!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.460
Garu!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:29.010
For badness's sake! What a mockery of horror this was!

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.160
It's not really spooky at all...

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:32.600
It's cute-garu.

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:33.340
Oh!

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:36.350
Spookcute?

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:37.410
Chanko!

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:39.930
Groan, groan!

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.820
I'm–I'm stuck!

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:47.420
How lovely!

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:55.170
And that's this room cleared.

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:58.490
Only Onee-chan would get scared by something like this.

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:00.330
Huh? Hey!

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:03.320
Why isn't anyone getting scared?

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:04.020
Oi.

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:04.710
Huh?

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.670
This is all tepid!

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.840
I'm–I'm sorry!

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:10.720
I <i>suspected</i> it might be you.

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:13.620
We figureded it out and came to see you!

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:16.100
It was fun! How do you do it-garu?

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:17.600
Well, you see...

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.270
<i>Here you go.</i>

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:22.110
<i>We look forward to working with you.</i>

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:23.480
<i>Yep, you got it!</i>

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:26.650
<i>I'll do my best to scare the pants off everyone!</i>

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:28.340
Look, fright here.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:33.320
This card reader turns the pictures on the cards you scan into reality!

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:37.880
So I used the cards I got from Horriwood and Proadway,

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:40.450
but they're not scaring anyone at all...

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.460
Oho! The cards become reality, you say?

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:47.150
Hm? Ran-tan's making the traps?

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:49.670
That's it. I'm a hundred pri-cent certain.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.510
That explains why it's not close to scary-kuma.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:54.980
I can cope with spookcute just fine!

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:56.390
This'll be a cinch-pri.

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:58.040
And we'll get that pri-formance, too...

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:59.100
Capisce!

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:03.770
Pushu...

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:06.220
And that's this room clear too-pri!

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:07.300
Capisce!

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:08.980
Let's keep it up, Sophie...

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:10.740
Hey, Sophie's gone.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:17.490
The Hanged Man.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:20.050
<i>This</i> is how you scare the daylights out of someone.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:20.990
All fright!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:24.180
This is the true dawn of Halloween!

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:28.460
Kuma!

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:32.420
What's going on?

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:35.130
Kuma-san!

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.500
Are you in one pri-iece?

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:37.660
Ku... Kuma...

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.130
He's alive!

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:40.100
But hey...

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:42.010
Gr... gross...

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:47.020
I'm saved... Sure, I'm saved...

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:49.020
But that's still really hard to bear!

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:53.860
Anyway, the mood here has totally changed-pri.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:56.490
Yeah, it's less spookcute and more just...

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:58.100
Unbearable!
Spooky.

00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:59.760
Unbearable!

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:04.790
So we're up against Ran-tan? This'll be a cinch!

00:10:05.420 --> 00:10:06.250
Death.

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:12.970
Here's a story, mememto mori!

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:14.380
Ajimi-sensei?

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:16.340
Et in PriPara ego!

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:18.260
Blood?

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:19.300
It's not blood!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:20.590
It's a paintbrush!

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:24.770
A fair-faced youth in the morning, crumbling bones in the evening – so gather ye rosebuds while ye may!

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:27.270
Begone, evil spirit!

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:30.740
Our graveyard becomes a grand ball at night!

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:33.650
Go forth in grave numbers, my skeletons!

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:35.150
Usa!

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:39.570
Hemmed in on all sides.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:41.390
I ain't scared of you, ya hear?

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.540
It's a good day to set out on a journey, Día de los Muertos.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:49.170
Look over there – it's Little Curly!

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:51.130
What? Little Curly?

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:53.090
Little Curly!

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:54.670
The dancers are fools, the watchers are fools!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:56.550
Both are fools alike, so shall we dance the Danse Macabre?

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:58.050
We're saved...

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:02.610
As if I'd... I'd be scared by such a cheap trick...

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:04.850
Dorothy, relax!

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:10.480
The Devil's power is unmatched on All Hallows' Eve!

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:12.490
That's amazing!

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:14.460
We surpriseded Shion, too!

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:16.190
Garuru wants to do more-garu!

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:18.440
Certainly – leave it to me!

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:19.860
The Moon.

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:26.080
What?

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:29.740
Ucha!

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:30.710
Usacha!

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:33.420
What's going on-ucha? Help me-ucha!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.670
Hand Usacha over!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:37.000
Ucha!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:37.840
Usacha!

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:40.840
Pepper not forgive you for touching Usacha!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.470
Prepare for fight! Bring it on!

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:46.700
Pepper strong!

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:49.640
Thank you-ucha! Pepper, you're so kind-ucha!

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.290
Usacha is food for me.

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:52.230
Ulp!

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:53.690
The Star!

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:02.820
If–If you think I'll be scared by this creature... you're underestimating me, I say!

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:04.910
Th–That's exactly right!

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:08.580
Chiri, clear this chamber and gain the right to perform straight away.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:12.720
I–I have no need to even exterminate this creature.

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:16.090
How filthy! How unclean!

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:17.880
Chiri-shan-shan, chiri-shan-shan!
Tsukikawa

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.790
Let it be exterminated! Let it be disinfected!

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:21.550
Chiri-shan-shan!

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:23.830
The Strength!

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:26.330
Dosukoi-chanko!

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:28.530
The Devil!

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:30.390
Love... lovely!

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:32.300
Devi-devi-devi-devi!

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:35.380
The Devil's banquet is in full swing!

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:38.270
Next is Temperance!

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:39.780
Gerun!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:44.450
It's fun-fun with meat buns!

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.490
The roof is shaking.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:48.850
I <i>thought</i> things took a strange turn earlier –

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:50.850
if Aroma's involved, that makes sense-pri!

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:53.150
Mikan-chan, that's really dangerous!

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:54.960
Will you stop this nonsense?

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:58.010
Devi-devi! My archangel at work!

00:12:58.010 --> 00:13:00.170
Mikan's huge! So cool!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.880
Miss Ran-tan! What's going on in here?

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:05.160
Look who's fear! It's Meganii-san!

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.020
Hm? Miss Ran-tan...

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.490
Thanks from the bottom of my black heart.

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:13.890
I've changed with the spookcute Ran-tan and brought true terror and pandemonium to PriPara's Halloween!

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:15.740
That won't do!

00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:20.270
The one we entrusted with scaring our Halloween guests was Miss Ran-tan!

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:21.780
Well, too bad.

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:25.240
A tepid Halloween is akin to Hell without its ruler!

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:25.860
Even so...

00:13:26.190 --> 00:13:29.070
You haven't forgotten your debt from that time, have you-neko?

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:39.420
Hey scare!

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.760
Now, go forth and terrorise, Mikan!

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:42.760
Go for it-garu!

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:44.210
Yep!

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.480
Love!
Dosukoi-chanko!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.050
rumble

00:13:51.050 --> 00:13:52.140
I'm hungry!
rumble

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.680
I'm hungry!

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.800
Such arrogance, to bear fangs against the Devil!

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:00.020
Aroma!

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:02.330
Garuru wants you to use this-garu!

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:03.480
Oho! This card, you say?

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:06.200
It's really cool! Garuru loves it-garu!

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:08.700
The Tank!

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:19.980
Ga-Gajira?

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:21.620
She's turned into a tank-pri?

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.500
We can't possibly fight <i>that</i>.

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:25.630
Everyone, let's run away!

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:28.930
Sophie?

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:30.890
Pushu...

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.850
Gajira!

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:35.310
Garu!

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:38.310
None can stand against our reign of terror!

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:41.400
Our participation in the Halloween performance is certain!

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:41.940
Mikan!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:42.730
Geru?

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.210
Let's rendezvous with Garuru!

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:46.690
We're gonna be number one at the goal!

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:49.680
Miss Ran-tan! Now's your chance!

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:52.650
You can use a card to save everyone!

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:54.730
Fright... but...

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:56.250
Spookcute is stronger than spooky! That's what I believe!

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:58.460
SPOOKCUTE > SPOOKY

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:01.880
Spookcute is... strong!

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:08.340
All fright... I'll make the strongest spookcute I can!

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:12.510
Pushu...

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.160
What? Sophie?

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:15.470
<i>Now</i> what's going on-pri?

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:23.230
What is that avian behemoth?

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:28.990
Gajira!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:38.020
Garuru.

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:39.540
Bad Garuru.

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:42.000
I'm sorry-garu.

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:46.670
You did it!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.720
The spookcute giant bird defeated Gajira!

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:51.680
You were marvellous, Miss Ran-tan!

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.740
Garuru! Very well done!

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:57.500
Let's get to the goal straight away!

00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:58.140
Garu!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:00.990
Let us seize the Halloween performance!

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:02.350
Hey, Aroma!

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:05.140
You're not getting in before us!

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:05.930
Capisce!

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:08.320
Pushu...

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:12.250
Goal!

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:14.040
First place is Garmageddon!

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:15.710
Objection!

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:19.450
Garmageddon didn't gather their points bear and square!

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:22.030
SoLaMi SMILE were in first legitimately!

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:24.960
So SoLaMi SMILE should have the right to perform!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.630
No objections!

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:30.800
Very well. SoLaMi SMILE, you may proceed as well.

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:40.640
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.020
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:45.200
Starting the Coord Change.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:53.400
A tomboyish kitty cat coord, perfect for our trickster trio!

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:56.160
Pink Cutie Cats Coord!

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:57.390
Devi!

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:01.910
With the jagged socks and spider web chain on the waist,

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:04.370
it brings out the hot appeal of spookcute!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:07.330
White Cutie Cats Coord!

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.520
Geru!

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:12.350
With nails are polished to a gleam,

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:15.260
they'll take first prize in the PriPara Halloween Costume Contest!

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:18.300
Orange Cutie Cats Coord!

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:20.220
Garu!

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:22.410
Making Drama, switch on!

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:25.700
Garu!

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:27.290
Onward!

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:28.330
Geru!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:29.540
Garu!
Geru!

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:37.350
Mischievous Macaroon Factory!

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:41.000
Gajira!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:45.500
Super Cyalume Change!

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:51.440
Devi!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.030
Geru!

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:52.830
Garu!

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:04.530
Aroma, you're the greatest!

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:06.330
Mikan, you're so lovely!

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:08.080
Please eat me, Garuru!

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:17.090
The fluffy pumpkin pants are adorable!

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:19.100
This time it's a colourful witch style!

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:21.470
Pinky Little Witch Halloween Coord!

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:28.190
The arms and waist are accessorised with pumpkins!

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:29.660
It's a pumpkin extravaganza!

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:32.410
Funky Little Witch Halloween Coord!

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:33.240
Pri!

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:39.640
The miniature hat is designed by Miss Ran-tan, a key point!

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:42.450
Tricky Little Witch Halloween Coord!

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:12.350
Making Drama, switch on!

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:21.990
Welcome

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:23.570
to our

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:24.910
Halloween night!

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:27.300
There we go!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:37.090
Trick or Treat! Halloween Party!

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:40.380
Super Cyalume Change!

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:47.010
Happy Halloween!

00:20:59.630 --> 00:21:01.900
Here we go!

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:07.740
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:10.990
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:14.720
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:19.540
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:41.390
The closet's doors open for you...

00:21:41.390 --> 00:21:44.100
Within is an item fit for a Divine Idol!

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:52.230
SoLaMi SMILE!

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:53.950
Happy Halloween!

00:21:57.140 --> 00:22:01.550
Viewers are sending in a mountain of messages saying "You went too far this time"!

00:22:01.550 --> 00:22:02.340
Garu...

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:05.290
Meganee... you'll receive your blessing one day...

00:22:06.120 --> 00:22:08.050
She's saying she'll curse you!

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:09.260
Say that again?

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:11.970
Oh – oh, it was nothing-neko!

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:14.540
All fright...

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:17.760
I fell inside the pumpkin...

00:23:52.330 --> 00:23:54.950
I'll trust in Usacha's words!

00:23:54.950 --> 00:23:56.930
I want to make a team with Chiri and Pepper!

00:23:56.930 --> 00:23:59.450
Me happy as long as me can eat Usacha!

00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:02.020
I couldn't possibly!

00:24:02.020 --> 00:24:04.880
I have to practice my flower arrangement...

00:24:04.880 --> 00:24:07.170
Then we'll help you!

00:24:07.170 --> 00:24:10.290
So will you consider forming a team with us?

00:24:10.290 --> 00:24:12.300
Here's a licky-stick for luck!

00:24:12.300 --> 00:24:13.530
Pepper!

00:24:13.960 --> 00:24:16.830
Next time, <i>It's Not Going Sweetly For NonSugar</i>!

00:24:16.830 --> 00:24:19.850
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
